:overallintent_instance rdf:type :OverallIntent ;
                rdfs:label "the overallintent"@en ;
                rdfs:comment "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Mysogynous; overall-intent-description: The image features a dog with an aggressive expression, overlaid with text stating 'i hate women so much' and 'i'm not even joking bro'. The visual of the dog's snarl is juxtaposed with the hateful text to create a meme that expresses extreme misogyny. The intent is to convey a hateful message against women, using the dog's aggressive appearance as a visual metaphor for the speaker's supposed rage. This is a clear example of mysogynous content, as it directly attacks women as a group with hateful language, and the meme format amplifies the toxicity by presenting it as a serious, unironic declaration."@en ;
                :extractionMethod "llm_extraction_huggingface" ;
                :extractedFrom "69085.png" ;
                :extractionTimestamp "2025-12-19T10:17:12.509581" .

